+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+/*
+ * Minimal fbdev driver for the X1830 DPU in the GameKiddy GKD350.
+ *
+ * The X1830 display block is not register-compatible with the older
+ * JZ47xx LCDC supported by ingenic-drm.  This driver intentionally exposes
+ * only the fixed mode and descriptor layout used by the 320x240 panel.
